----------------------------------------------------------------------
ATTRIBUTION & ARCHITECTURE NOTICE
----------------------------------------------------------------------

DDT Custom Discord Client integrates proprietary and open-source enhancements,
including:

1. CORE ENHANCEMENTS:
   - DDT-Asar: Custom ultra-fast OpenAsar core engine (~47 KB, 4x startup boost,
     custom branding, zero telemetry).
   - DDT Active Titlebar HUD & Status indicators.
   - Smart self-deploy scripts (deploy.py, install.py, INSTALL.ps1).

2. DDT EXCLUSIVE & SPECIALIZED PLUGINS:
   - API Inspector & Network Inspector: Deep gateway and REST protocol inspection.
   - Event Logger: Live client and dispatch event debugger.
   - Token Manager & Account Switcher: Encrypted multi-account and token vault.
   - Developer Theme & Theme Manager: Instant runtime switching for 112+ themes.
   - Dev Tools Panel & Console Cleaner: Streamlined memory and console controls.
   - DDT Quest Automator: Automated Discord quest progress and reward claiming.
   - DDT Dynamic Island: Physics-based floating HUD for notifications and media.
   - DDT Message Logger: Client-side deleted/edited message audit retention.
   - DDT Announcements & In-App Auto Updater.
   - Over 290+ built-in modular user plugins.

3. CREDITS:
   - Vencord: https://github.com/Vendicated/Vencord (GPL-3.0)
   - OpenAsar: https://github.com/GooseMod/OpenAsar (MIT / GPL-3.0)
   - Community plugin creators and theme designers acknowledged across respective files.
